\section{Unifying Bayesian, Frequentist, and Imprecise Reasoning}\label{unifying}

In this section, we show how a diagram involving Bayesian, Conformal, and Imprecise Probabilistic prediction methods, commute in category $\mathbf{UHCont}$. We focus on the latter rather than $\mathbf{WMeas}_\text{uc}$ because its objects and morphisms have less restricting requirements. 

Since the diagram commuting is an extension of the Full CP Diagram in Theorem \ref{conf-pred-diagr}, we retain assumptions \ref{H1}-\ref{H5}. 
