where $P\in\Delta^\text{dens}_\Theta$. We assume that $k_n(\theta,y^n)$ is $\Sigma_\Theta$-measurable in $\theta$ for each $y^n\in Y^n$, and Borel in $y^n$ for each $\theta$.
