We apply SpecRKHS-UniMeasure (\cref{unispecmeas_alg}) to the two M\"obius maps
\begin{equation}
    T_1(z)=e^{i\pi/3},\qquad T_2(z)=\frac{\sqrt{2}e^{i\pi\sqrt{3}}z+e^{i\pi 9/7}}{e^{-i\pi 9/7}z+\sqrt{2}e^{-i\pi\sqrt{3}}},
