    \includegraphics[width=0.45\linewidth]{infinite_graph_perturbation_spec_meas.pdf}
    \caption{Random walk. Left: Approximation to spectral measure of system defined by \cref{stochasticexample_eqn} using SpecRKHS-SAdjMeasure (\cref{saspecmeas_alg}). The exact expression of the spectral measure $\rho_f$ is given in \cref{radonnikodymexact_eqn}, and the boundary of the spectrum is shown by the dashed vertical lines. We have shown two values of $m$ (order of the convolution kernel). Right: Approximation to the spectral measure of a random perturbation of the same system. Here, we vary $\epsilon$ and observe convergence to the continuous spectra and eigenvalues.}
