b_{l}\right) \cap \bar{\sigma}\left( \bar{w}\right) \not=\varnothing $.

Using again (\ref{inner-translation}) and (\ref{inner-event}), we have 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\mathcal{T}_{\bar{L}\rightarrow L}^{-}\left( \lnot \bar{l}\right) &=&\vee
_{\left \{ w^{\prime }\in W\mid \sigma \left( w^{\prime }\right) \subseteq 
