\\ \sigma \left( w^{\prime }\right) \subseteq \bar{A}}}\right \} }l_{%
w^{\prime }} \\
&=&\vee _{\left \{ _{\substack{ w^{\prime }\in W\mid \sigma \left( w^{\prime
}\right) \cap \bar{\sigma}\left( b_{\bar{l}}\right) =\varnothing  \\ \sigma
\left( w^{\prime }\right) \subseteq \bar{A}}}\right \} }l_{w%
^{\prime }}
