^{\prime }\right) \cap \sigma \left( b_{l}\right) =\varnothing  \\ \bar{%
\sigma}\left( \bar{w}^{\prime }\right) \subseteq A}}\right \} }\bar{l}%
_{\bar{w}^{\prime }}
