In other words, the \emph{standard} BV theory is BV symplectomorphic to the \emph{restricted} one plus some additional parts proportional to $v$. We can then apply a BV pushforward to $(\mathcal{F}_H,\varpi_H, S_H)$, integrating $v$ in order to obtain the \emph{restricted} theory. This will be made explicit in Section \ref{s:BV-pushforward_Gravity_Hedgehog}.
