Using the decompositions \eqref{e:omegadecomp_d4},  $\omega= \widehat{\omega}+ v$ and \eqref{e:split_omegan_dag}, $\underline{\omega}_n^\dag= \underline{\widehat{\omega}}_n^\dag + \underline{v}^{\dag} $ in the standard BV gravity symplectic form \eqref{e:standard_symplectic_form_split}, we get
\begin{align} 
    \varpi_{s}
    &= \varpi_{r} + \int_{\Sigma \times I}\delta \widehat{\omega}  \delta \underline{v}^\dag +\delta v \delta \underline{\widehat{\omega}}^\dag_n +\delta v \delta  \underline{v}^\dag.
\end{align}

The difference with $\varpi_H$ \eqref{e:sympl_form_H} is then given by the terms $\delta \widehat{\omega}  \delta \underline{v}^\dag +\delta v \delta \underline{\widehat{\omega}}^\dag_n$. We can write the first as 
\begin{align*}
