\begin{tabular}{cc}
Parameter&Value\\
\hline
Waveguide radius $R$&$0.6\,mm$\\
Inner tubular plasma radius $a$&$0.2\,mm$\\
Outer tubular plasma radius $b$& $0.4\,mm$\\
Plasma background density $n_{p(1)}, n_{p(3)}$&$1.23\cdot 10^{14}\,cm^{-3}$\\
Tubular plasma density $n_{p(2)}$&$1.63\cdot 10^{15}\,cm^{-3}$\\
