Note that, in a restricted injective t-NUCA both the rules may not be injective. Restricted injectivity of a t-NUCA depends on the set of initial configuration, where each restriction, $G_t|_{\mathcal{C}_t}: \mathcal{C}_t\rightarrow\mathcal{C}_{t+1}$ is injective.

