\, \cdot\,  d_{0}^{2}\,  d_{-1}^{5}\,  d_{-2}^{3}
= a^{d_{0}^{2}\,  d_{-1}^{5}\,  d_{-2}^{3}}=a^{\tilde d_{\rho f}}.
\end{split}
\end{equation*}
This means that the benign subgroup $Q$ of $\bar{\mathscr{A}} \!\times\! {\mathscr{A}}$ actually is of a simple format:
$$
