\big(\bar a^{\bar d_f},\; a^{\tilde d_{\rho f}}\!\big)
\;|\;  f\in \mathcal X
\big\rangle
= \big\langle 
(\bar a,\; a)^{\lambda_f}
\;|\;  f\in \mathcal X
\big\rangle.
$$
Using this with \eqref{EQ a_f = a^b_f = a^d_f} we see that $Q$ lies inside $\bar F \!\times\! F$, and so $Q$ is benign in $\bar F \!\times\! F$ also for the same choice of $K_Q$ and $L_Q$ made earlier.
