%
For any $f\!\in \mathcal X$,
for any positive $n$, 
and for any \textit{odd} integer index $j=2k\!+\!1$ we again by Lemma~\ref{LE action of d_m on f} 
% in analogy with \eqref{EQ apply d^n on a_f}  
compute in $\bar {\mathscr{A}}^*$:
\begin{equation}
\label{EQ next apply odd d_j on a_f}
