\bar F \cap 
\langle\, \bar A_{\mathcal X}, O\rangle$, i.e., $\bar A_{\vartheta \mathcal X}$ is constructed from three benign subgroups $\bar A_{\mathcal X},\, O,\, \bar F$ by a join and an intersection. 
