\label{SU Extracting A theta X from Q} 

To ``extract'' the $A_{\theta \mathcal X}$ from $Q$ notice that by Corollary~\ref{CO intersection and join are benign multi-dimensional}\;\eqref{PO 2 CO intersection and join are benign multi-dimensional} the join 
