In addition to the groups given in the above proof set the auxiliary groups  
$V_{\mathcal E_0}=L_0=\langle g \rangle$ and $\Lambda_0=\mathscr{G}$. Since this $V_{\mathcal E_0}$ already is finitely generated, it trivially is benign in finitely generated $\mathscr{G}$ for the stated finitely presented $\Lambda_0$ and for the finitely generated $L_0$, see Remark~\ref{RE finite generated is benign}. 

