\big((F \times \mathcal L)\,*_{\1 \times  \mathcal L}\; w_3\big) 
\,*_{F \times \mathcal L}
(K_{Q_1} *_{L_{Q_1}} w_4),
$$
and for its finitely generated subgroup
$L_{Z_{\mathcal X}} 
=(F \times \mathcal L)^{w_3 w_4}$.
%
Since $Z_{\mathcal X}$ is entirely inside $\langle z,r,\,s \rangle$, 
we have $\langle z,r,\,s \rangle \cap\, L_{Z_{\mathcal X}} \!= Z_{\mathcal X}$, that is, $Z_{\mathcal X}$ also is benign in  $\langle z,r,\,s \rangle$ for the same groups $K_{Z_{\mathcal X}}$ and $L_{Z_{\mathcal X}}$ constructed above.














