We will be discussing in this section how we can transition from a use-case or MVC software development to intelligent agents using LLMs as interfaces. In the following example, we want to examine the complexity of adding the user story of ordering a Margherita gourmet pizza in 20 minutes to a food app, as 
an optimization to the the flow presented in Figure~\ref{fig:order-pizza}.

