    \caption{ \textbf{(a)} Wavefunction overlap between the initially excited B850 and polaritons (orange), and between the initially excited B850 and the external B850s (black); \textbf{(b)} wavefunction overlap between the polaritons and the external B850s. An external B850 state close to resonance with the polariton is present with $N_\text{LH2}$ $>$ 4.  The overlaps were calculated as described in the main text with $g_0$=0.2 cm$^{-1}$.}
    \label{mainoverlaps}
