        In each of Lemma \ref{lem_inthyptorus} and Lemma \ref{lem_inthyppants}, Condition (2) is not stated explicitly in \cite{goldman}, however it is nevertheless satisfied, as the proofs rely on Lemma \ref{lem_plpchar} and Lemma \ref{prop_plpliftcommu}.
