            %Moreover, for any $n\in \mathbb{Z}$ and $s\in\{-1,0,+1\}^3$ with $s_3=0$ such that $\mathrm{HP}_n^s(\Sigma_{0,3})$ is non-empty, the image $\ev\big(\mathrm{HP}^{s}_n(\Sigma_{0,3})\big)$ equals $\Hyp_n$.
