        See Figure \ref{fig: evimage}. To prove Proposition \ref{prop_evimage}, we need the following lemma.

        \begin{lemma}\label{lem_evimage}
            The subsets  $\ev\Big(\overline{\Hyp}\times \overline{\Hyp}\Big)$ and  $ \Par_1^+\cup \Par_{-1}^-\cup\{z^{\pm 1}\}$ of $\univcover$ are disjoint. 
        \end{lemma}
        \begin{proof}
            If 
