            = sgn(ab)$ when $ab\neq 0$; and equal $sgn\big(cde^{-\lambda t}(e^{\eta t} - e^{-\eta t})\big)
            = sgn(cd)$ when $cd\neq 0$. In particular, all $\widetilde{g_{1,t}g_{2,t}}$, $t\in (0, 1],$ have the same sign. 

