    In this section, we prove Theorem \ref{thm_main4} for punctured surfaces $\Sigma$ of Euler characteristic $-2$, namely, the two-hole torus and the four-hole sphere, and describe the connected components of $\R$. 
    For both of the cases, we need the following Proposition \ref{prop_sameEuler}.

