    \end{bmatrix}$; and by a re-parametrization if necessary, we can assume that 
        the projection $\{A_t\}\interval$ of the path $\{\widetilde{g_{1,t}}\}\interval$  in $\univcover$ to $\SL$ equals 
        $$A_t
        = \begin{bmatrix}
